 1203 f770: 0d 52               LDTI 'R'
 1204 f772: a8 f8 a4            BREQ vcreg
 1205 f775: 1f fe e0            MVIW R7,VHELP
 1206 f778: a0 f7 b9            BR vcmsg
 1207 f77b: 04 f5 31    vcprob: JSR vprobe
 1208 f77e: a0 f7 95            BR vcstat
