 1667 fa4d:             ;
 1668 fa4d:             ; 2026-09-25: the video mirror. With VIDMIR and VIDPRES set the byte also goes to the screen (vputc, which keeps
 1669 fa4d:             ; every register and TMP); with VIDMIR 0 this costs a PUSH, an LDA, a BRZ and a POP, and the UART path below is as
 1670 fa4d:             ; it was. ACC, TMP and R3-R7 are kept either way (R2 is LDA's address register, as in every LDA).
 1671 fa4d:             ;
 1672 fa4d: 09                  PUSH
