 1677 fa59: a2 fa 61            BRNZ chnovid            ;   ($FF on the emulators) must not turn the mirror on with VCOLSV/VLINE garbage
 1678 fa5c: 0a                  POP
 1679 fa5d: 09                  PUSH
 1680 fa5e: 04 f5 f0            JSR vputc
 1681 fa61:             chnovid:
 1682 fa61: 0a                  POP
